<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups and bandits keep attacking civilians in northern Nigeria, driving tens of thousands into Niger and prompting troops to rescue kidnapping victims in Niger and Adamawa, while a suspected Nigerien terrorist threatened a mass attack on Nigeria's Niger State over alleged killings of Fulani people. In Chad, 23 soldiers, including a company commander, were killed fighting over the Tibesti gold mines. Mali's forces recaptured Kidal using Russian electronic-warfare vehicles and Africa Corps drones are conducting lethal strikes in Mali, as rival terror groups continue to devastate the Sahel. Russia helped foil a coup in Niger, drawing EU concern over Algerian and Russian troop deployments, and Mer Group secured a €46 million West African intelligence and cyber contract. 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9nbXFMQ3VGb1NoQmhSRlh0dUdpU1ZGVm44MVRxZFNGODFuVmp1RjRGR2hLYzZnUWpUWWpoV0RieWpCZ0lYVXJwR1ZMTlgtOThMdmVTcUhveElmcEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE1KSHFweTlaZnN5blZobkpqV3pQR2NWVHNqWnQ2eF9yNlVBaHg4QlpVOTFFVnVMaUh1RVFuZjg2dDgtdXhDWGFHeEloRnJQRzd1YlpaUThMY01vc1loZkR5ZGNEbENwakFWcnZJMkdtRjRscm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;DIIS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;zagazola.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CB